1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & DELIVERABLES
================================================================================
This submission contains the complete source code, database definitions, 
installation instructions, and documentation for PennyPal, an intelligent, 
cross-platform student personal finance and budgeting platform.

Consolidated Project Submission Package:
1. Source Code: Complete multi-platform Flutter codebase (Android, iOS, Web).
2. Database Scripts: 'pennypal_schema.sql' containing all 10 SQL tables.
3. Compiled Package: 'build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-arm64-v8a-release.apk' (Release APK).
4. Documentation Report: 'docs/PennyPal_Project_Documentation_Report.md'
5. Architecture Slide Deck: 'docs/PennyPal Architecture Deep Dive.pdf'
6. Demonstration Video: 'PennyPal_Demo_Video.mp4' (walkthrough of all modules).

